  "abstract": null,
  "content": "<div class=\"qz-editor-engine am-engine\" data-element=\"root\"><p data-id=\"p838747a-i2Ub5KVQ\">该类报错属于正常业务校验，使用AccessToken下并没有本次请求账户id的授权权限。在请求接口前我们需要先通过接口查询确认AccessToken下可操作账户，根据返回结果请求拥有权限的账户。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-XmGS5Hb9\"><br></p><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-GZJTAVPG\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-GZJTAVPG\">一、如何管理AccessToken与账户关系</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-PvMWivB9\">在一个开发者应用APPID下，同一个账户下共用一套Token（AccessToken、RefreshToken），完整的授权关系记录应该为 APPID -&gt; AccessToken -&gt; User -&gt; account/advertiser（业务账户）。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-rOp2zyux\"><br></p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-F6d5jAKA\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-F6d5jAKA\">1.1 获取Token对应User关系</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-FSWOBmJ9\">可通过接口【<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710507039756\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取授权User信息</a>】查询AccessToken对应的User信息，查询到的User信息，则是对应用户在授权链接页面登录的对应账户（授权页面左上角的邮箱/手机号）。</p><ul data-id=\"u32e1807-R3aGt7Gj\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-YPEcoNzU\">多个AccessToken对应同一个User时，可以仅保留最新的一个AccessToken</li></ul><p data-id=\"p838747a-yDaxPpsY\"><br></p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-67AXCAMB\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-67AXCAMB\">1.2 获取Token下对应授权业务账户</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-7SYtmHGi\">可通过接口【<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710506574848\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取已授权账户</a>】查询AccessToken对应的可操作业务账户列表，应用业务场景不同对应操作账户角色也不同。</p><div class=\"table-container qz-card-type-block\"><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-left\"></div><div class=\"scrollbar-shadow-right\"></div><div class=\"table-content-scroll\" style=\"overflow-y: scroll\"><table data-id=\"thsgybhl4-n5vmo7int6o000\" data-custom=\"true\" class=\"data-table\" style=\"width: 880px; outline: none; border-collapse: collapse;\" data-transient-attributes=\"class\" data-width=\"880px\"><colgroup data-id=\"c1e4a4ebk-19vyp6w8ocrk000\"><col width=\"70\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"cikyvergw-1iwlzcrd8a5c000\"><col width=\"221\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"cikzrv9uo-kk9ikctrgnk00\"><col width=\"313\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c55to125z-u2qmzz7ijk0000\"><col width=\"274\" span=\"1\" data-id=\"c55txkoqo-1ll1aleo5a1s000\"></colgroup><tbody data-id=\"t1dr9qg4g-ys56dsil8jk000\"><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-h3zxt3rcge8000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-15sv7yhppgf4000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-11448gtbsd4g000\">业务场景</p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-1d4i223dg5s0000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1byy3py6ibz4000\">账户类型 account_role</p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-lh9mb6ty340000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-18s2rmebi0g0000\">账户信息</p></td><td data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-nj1psz1pzg0000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-vgsrv8o0x40000\">子集业务账户</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-gsk5j35uek8000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"8\" data-id=\"t1gc62pvk-6zhhfa7i1sc000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-o4lfaulzayo000\">巨量营销</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-6xagwwzaquk000\"><br></p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-1cktyuk4q4rk000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-u6h46xte0xc000\">CUSTOMER_ADMIN </p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-u0mnxqv1f8w000\">旧版巨量引擎工作台管理员</p></td><td rowspan=\"2\" data-id=\"t1gc62pvk-10ueqzruvku8000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1jqjbai7qyzk000\">旧版巨量引擎工作台账户可以分配给多个User，根据不同User分配账户权限不同对应，区分管理员和协作者（建议使用管理员授权）</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-g9oxnryaty8000\">对应advertiser_id返回为旧版巨量引擎工作台账户ID，旧版巨量引擎工作台账户下管理的具体业务账号可以通过【<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710520884224\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取旧版巨量引擎工作台下资产账户列表</a>】查询</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-11atu60sdm6o000\"><br></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\" data-id=\"t55ekiwdc-96mk4fbql0w000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u23e7sf9c-g7lpwph6gow000\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1awjcquflleo000\">巨量投放账户（account_source = AD）</li></ul><ul data-indent=\"1\" data-id=\"u1m6a43eo-1k98ge69h6zk000\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-2si7lsutjpk000\">advertiser_id 为对应客户ID，只可请求操作巨量营销相关业务接口</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u23e7sf9c-iq20spr7t0o000\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1bfdtb6v0af4000\">本地推账户（account_source = LOCAL）</li></ul><ul data-indent=\"1\" data-id=\"u1m6a43eo-hj04j85s4q8000\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1jnqii00iee800\">advertiser_id为对应本地推账户ID，只可请求操作本地推相关业务接口</li></ul></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-27yyzxd7siv400\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-13aru5eh23ww000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1i276iec49i8000\">CUSTOMER_OPERATOR </p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-g2ykpdijk74000\">旧版巨量引擎工作台协作者</p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t1dr9j7ls-1g5lzospe75s000\" style=\"height: 87px;\"><td data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tnqaqat9c-ozj8e5d9eow000\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-zxiayjv1lts000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_ENTERPRISE_BP_ADMIN</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-g2u0xn9iymw000\">升级版巨量引擎工作台管理员</p></td><td data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tnqaqat9c-2y2smoq30jm000\" rowspan=\"2\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1jdh1b0saq80000\">升级版巨量引擎工作台账户可以分配给多个User，根据不同User分配账户权限不同对应，区分管理员和协作者（建议使用管理员授权）</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-157j4g1st5ts000\">对应advertiser_id返回为升级版巨量引擎工作台账户ID，升级版巨量引擎工作台账户下管理的具体业务账号可以通过【<a href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710520884224\" target=\"blank\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\"></a><a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1829550825614739\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取升级版巨量引擎工作台下账户列表</a>】查询</p></td><td data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tnqaqat9c-1dnu02ju3mhs000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-lenf5wkruf4000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t1dr9j7ls-n0wc8ip1640000\"><td data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tnqaqat9c-oi3oe5w4chs000\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1a350zyvgbls000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_ENTERPRISE_BP_OPERATOR</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-5ft9lpy6now000\">升级版巨量引擎工作台协作者</p></td><td data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\" colspan=\"1\" data-id=\"tnqaqat9c-r8uk9bb198g000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227); vertical-align: top;\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-18qvh0l43z40000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-70lr3v45q48000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-ukkmsumar7k000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1en4au2ezpb4000\">AGENT </p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-quwcv0rqtz4000\">方舟代理商账户</p></td><td rowspan=\"2\" data-id=\"t1gc62pvk-1g5gnydee074000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-qcb0jcad3nk000\">对应advertiser_id返回为代理商账户ID，代理商下管理的具体业务账号可以通过【<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/7/docs/1696710516003852\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">代理商管理账户列表</a>】查询</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1h1wembak4zk000\">company_list不为空时，代表仅能访问该部分客户id下的adv，以company_list下customer_company_id为准</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1ig6wbmrey2o000\"><br></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\" data-id=\"t55ekiwdc-j0oxsve5vo0000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u23e7sf9c-121lysw69tls000\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1fy82jffgatc000\">巨量投放账户（account_source = AD）</li></ul><ul data-indent=\"1\" data-id=\"u1m6a43eo-15s2cqsqk30g000\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-tyzen656vuo000\">list内内容为对应客户ID，只可请求操作巨量营销相关业务接口</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u23e7sf9c-66fb1vu17ug000\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-10j3iw5o6oe8000\">星图账户（account_source = STAR）</li></ul><ul data-indent=\"1\" data-id=\"u1m6a43eo-vgzm5c0absg000\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-1f6uo5vutlwg000\">list内内容为对应星图账户ID，只可请求操作巨量星图相关业务接口</li></ul><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-4wmn5dxjg14000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-4tvvia2ves8000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-5k50al9k9s0000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-ub49jzdd900000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_STAR_AGENT </p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-kniddy631cw000\">星图代理商</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-mezpjakypgg000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-4s099t3wwvq000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-109gbgn5bjmo000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-ncywu21u5s0000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_STAR </p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1en5tlpkls3k000\">星图账户</p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-7018p8p9f34000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-bv45j4mqbeo000\">对应advertiser_id返回为星图账户ID，只可请求操作巨量星图相关业务接口</p></td><td data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-1el7xb4dy0e8000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-i1uxe3933zk00\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p2krvvzmc-evhhi1fhzkw000\" style=\"text-align: center;\">/</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-srczy68dh34000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-yjgx9q4n0ww000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-10pihop6oji8000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-10xen0697lg0000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_AWEME </p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-rx0h26pt50w000\">抖音号</p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-54rwqeukw34000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-ignxofc7zk8000\">对应account_string_id返回为DOU+账户ID，只可请求DOU+相关业务接口</p></td><td data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-z0x8nmq7280000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-kg26hvv4ie8000\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p2krvvzmc-ef6ygwtvxb4000\" style=\"text-align: center;\">/</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-eikinf0ltr4000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-14jse752q4ao000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td rowspan=\"5\" data-id=\"t42gb2kp2-x4nftl5qgm8000\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1m1ky3gyyz6o000\">巨量千川</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1abq8prq956o000\"><br></p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-121xd68hueqo000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-110ya0zb74tc000\">ADVERTISER </p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-130k4cqpfpvk000\">投放账户</p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-127rtftmmrao000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-15wn81mj83k0000\">对应advertiser_id返回为随心推账户ID，只可请求千川随心推相关业务接口能力</p></td><td data-id=\"t1fi1b2aw-1mauh950amww000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1hly6azbwy2o000\"><br></p><p data-id=\"p2krvvzmc-89epnznr8ac000\" style=\"text-align: center;\">/</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-gwkigv9d3k0000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-p3vql2onc00000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-d5o65x04se8000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-gf3fr7isoww000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_SHOP_ACCOUNT </p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-qn6aia2wk8w000\">抖店店铺</p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-310eaxck884000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1aahf1hg808w000\">对应advertiser_id返回为千川店铺ID，店铺下管理的具体业务账号可以通过【<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697467801357320\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取店铺关联账户列表</a>】查询</p></td><td rowspan=\"2\" data-id=\"t55ekiwdc-14b76cij2ekg000\" class=\"table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u23e7sf9c-3nz0bl5c73e000\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-7dqbo9sp4ms000\">extra_permission 不包含 QC_AWEME</li></ul><ul data-indent=\"1\" data-id=\"u1m6a43eo-100bcjji7n2o000\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-f5xkeb1knq0000\">adv_id为对应千川客户ID，仅支持操作千川PC相关业务接口能力</li></ul><ul data-id=\"u23e7sf9c-1k5mjkpaaan4000\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-b3rilkmb9m8000\">extra_permission 包含 QC_AWEME </li></ul><ul data-indent=\"1\" data-id=\"u1m6a43eo-rdz6g48xna8000\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-12qpbfwrbw2o000\">adv_id可以作为随心推业务账户，可以使用千川随心推相关业务接口能力</li></ul></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-1i508epmd068000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-bgtsy5ht2qw000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-u1uqk80lsao000\">PLATFORM_ROLE_QIANCHUAN_AGENT </p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-s6dt23uhtxc000\">方舟代理商</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-166x83otn2hs000\"><br></p></td><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-b1vwdea6kv4000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-yq2qae37kcw000\">对应advertiser_id返回为代理商账户ID，代理商下管理的具体业务账号可以通过【<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1697467832592392\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">代理商管理账户列表</a>】查询</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-12osxv3dpei8000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-170d2wxwti80000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"to1v3dpz4-19o3bk9r78io000\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1397meb5nlj4000\">CUSTOMER_ADMIN </p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-jvcv650o9j4000\">旧版巨量引擎工作台管理员</p></td><td rowspan=\"2\" data-id=\"t42gb2kp2-newtango280000\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-wttot6ngmzk000\">旧版巨量引擎工作台账户可以分配给多个User，根据不同User分配账户权限不同对应，区分管理员和协作者（建议使用管理员授权）</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-1aict2l09sw0000\">对应advertiser_id返回为旧版巨量引擎工作台账户ID，旧版巨量引擎工作台账户下管理的具体业务账号可以通过【<a target=\"blank\" href=\"https://open.oceanengine.com/labels/12/docs/1796368918556803\" style=\"font-size: inherit; padding: 0px 2px; line-height: inherit; overflow-wrap: break-word; text-indent: 0px;\">获取旧版巨量引擎工作台下账户列表</a>】查询</p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-157g2wv16xz4000\"><br></p></td><td rowspan=\"2\" data-id=\"tbatapqp4-rhwhsxrv9i8000\" class=\"table-last-column table-last-row\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><ul data-id=\"u23e7sf9c-atufmq043ok000\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-p8ivx4sj6ww000\">巨量千川账户（account_source = QIANCHUAN ）</li></ul><ul data-indent=\"1\" data-id=\"u1m6a43eo-12d41dox3kc0000\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"l19a1dmf4-sebh4fprgwg000\">advertiser_id 为对应客户ID，只可请求操作巨量千川PC相关业务接口</li></ul><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-14378cw4yduk000\"><br></p></td></tr><tr data-id=\"t46mtzt4g-15aueglj29hc000\" style=\"height: 39px;\"><td data-id=\"t14oj2scg-2ybwszlhi0e000\" class=\"table-last-column\" style=\"vertical-align: top; min-width: auto; overflow-wrap: break-word; border: 1px solid rgb(222, 224, 227);\" data-transient-attributes=\"table-cell-selection\"><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-smcxwopkxj4000\">CUSTOMER_OPERATOR </p><p data-id=\"p1dr9j7ls-tslyu5d20w0000\">旧版巨量引擎工作台协作者</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div></div><p data-id=\"p838747a-h8bZNRUI\"><br></p><h1 id=\"h346b9f0-YaWaDaIJ\" data-id=\"h346b9f0-YaWaDaIJ\">二、常见问题</h1><p data-id=\"p838747a-YOL2KHdx\">在遇到No permission报错时，可以先按照上述方式确认当前使用Token下是否拥有对应账户授权，如需操作相关账户则需要确认对应账号重新申请授权获取新的AccessToken请求使用。以下是请求接口时常见问题场景。</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-OBnz98NS\"><br></p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-YQJjWUn6\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-YQJjWUn6\">2.1 同一个Token之前可以操作某一个账户，再次请求或刷新Token后请求，提示No permission</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-FtoXiWiD\">刷新Token不会影响授权关系，以下是可能会出现该问题的场景</p><ol start=\"1\" data-id=\"o23eaf9c-AdAlPC64\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-KIgGDxei\">AccessToken是以User维度授权，对应User重新授权并更改了授权范围，则以最新一次授权选择为准</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-3xVbzpt1\">User账号与管理账户关系发生变动/管理账户下管理客户范围发生变动</li></ol><ol data-indent=\"1\" data-id=\"o7dab24e-1B7BNSPD\" style=\"list-style-position: inside;\"><li data-id=\"ld70c578-girJABHP\">User与管理账户关系变动：如「旧版巨量引擎工作台账户1」管理员分配给User账号协作权限，则User帐号为「旧版巨量引擎工作台账户1」协作者，后续管理员取消了权限分配，User则没有权限继续操作「旧版巨量引擎工作台账户1」</li><li data-id=\"ld70c578-tfYLRFjl\">管理账户管理客户范围变动：如「旧版巨量引擎工作台账户1」在旧版巨量引擎工作台工作台管理客户范围发生变动，如历史有管理「客户1」后续取消了管理权限分配</li></ol><p data-id=\"p838747a-JnTVF3ds\"><br></p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-lhi1e0oU\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-lhi1e0oU\">2.2 授权时勾选了对应账户，但是获取Token查询时没有对应账户权限</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-2j2TnsGd\">同一个业务账户可以分配给多个User，注意授权页面左上角展示当前登录User信息与对应使用Token查询对应User信息是否是同一个账户</p><p data-id=\"p838747a-hac7iwQR\"><br></p><h2 id=\"h490b8bf-cD1gHhEL\" data-id=\"h490b8bf-cD1gHhEL\">2.3 授权页面提示无可授权账户列表</h2><p data-id=\"p838747a-4XxH2ghH\">授权页面登录账户下并没有应用相关管理账户，注意授权页面登录账号是否与对应管理平台登录账户一致，确认对应应用支持的授权账户类型。</p></div>",
